 now look i was  pretty harsh on run but overall it's a  totally fun ride where you can just turn  off your brain and enjoy the run  okay bad pun if you've got nothing to do  on a sunday afternoon  definitely check it out thanks for  watching everyone if you want to help me  out in the channel be sure to like  subscribe and comment what you thought  of the movie below  for more bad takes you can follow me on  twitter and instagram at thingstoryt  until next time remember daddy loves you  very much

